{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18106160","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18106160","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1810616001:0":{"text":"Death's below... Every time Lady Tephesia has <style=\"highlight\">dance lessons</style> with Lady Cynthia, she runs off halfway through!","source_cn":"死神在下……一到辛西娅女士的<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08673D7E2EA4DD11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1810616002:0":{"text":"*Sigh* She's probably hiding somewhere, <style=\"highlight\">sneaking drinks meant for the living again</style>. <style=\"highlight\">Lord Progenitor</style> explicitly warned her not to consume those too often. She's supposed to relieve her discomfort with blood...","source_cn":"唉，恐怕她又躲起来<style=highlight>偷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB211C4A9740FB767","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810616003:0":{"text":"I wonder when Lady Tephesia will finally adjust to life as a vampire and leave these mortal habits behind...","source_cn":"不知道要到什么时候，苔佩希小姐才能适应吸血鬼的习惯，改...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x403CFC124AE74685","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810616004:0":{"text":"Lady Tephesia... Lord Progenitor... the living...","source_cn":"苔佩希小姐、始祖殿下、生者……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC2C24B327DC330F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810616005:0":{"text":"Thane, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I'm not imagining this, right?","source_cn":"瑟恩，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9861355763DC2C00","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Thane, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I'm not imagining this, right?","female":"Thane, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I'm not imagining this, right?","variant_male_record_index":"244030","variant_female_record_index":"244031","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1810616006":{"text":"So Tephesia was once human. And the Mortimer family has a Progenitor. He's probably the same \"Mortimer\" mentioned in that diary.","source_cn":"所以，苔佩希曾经是生者。莫蒂默家族还有一位始祖，他很有可能就是刚才那本日记中提到的“莫蒂默先生”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9780745BCD5C41D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810616006:0":{"text":"So Tephesia was once human. And the Mortimer family has a Progenitor. He's probably the same \"Mortimer\" mentioned in that diary.","source_cn":"所以，苔佩希曾经是生者。莫蒂默家族还有一位始祖，他很有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9780745BCD5C41D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810616007:0":{"text":"Which means the child who wrote it...","source_cn":"那么那本日记的主人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BFFB53F00C41B55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":